    {
      "strength": "STRONG",
      "observation": "Both datasets miss their registered selected practical thresholds on both readouts. MovieLens selected intervals for P0−B0 and GP0−G0 exclude their practical positive margins. KuaiRand fixed EMA GP0−G0 is negative in all five seeds, its paired interval excludes zero, every cell decreases, and Macro LogLoss increases. Online corroborates within the same trajectories."
    },
    {
      "strength": "STRONG",
      "observation": "At fixed E10, P0−B0 and GP0−G0 are positive for all five seeds on both datasets with fixed EMA. Both selected and E50 means reverse sign. The same-epoch E10 AUC advantage therefore has a different outcome from independently selected ranking performance."
    },
    {
      "strength": "MEDIUM",
      "observation": "KuaiRand selected P0 improves d0 task AUCs but reduces both d1 task AUCs, d2 task effects are mixed and Traffic and Pooled AUC decrease. The balance is a concrete trade-off within this arm. In GP0−G0, all six cells decline, with the deepest loss in d0t1. Domain size alone cannot explain these patterns."
    },
    {
      "strength": "WEAK",
      "observation": "Observed changes are compatible with shifts in objective mass, optimization stage, and the added D0 pairwise view. The combined base/view design does not identify which caused the GP0 degradation. Future falsification on the same Gaussian BCE background would contrast clean versus Gaussian pairwise with identical pair IDs, dose and seeds, only under a separately approved study."
    }
  ]
